    /** v0.8.0 4-pad analog touch module: which pad is touched, 1..4 (0 = none, -1 = invalid pin). Ranges = BRIXEL reference (ESP32 0..4095 / 4) with 15 counts of margin, same as the BrixelAI DSL micro:bit card. */
